//timetrack.dk/brand/tt-ikon-64.png" style="display:inline-block;outline:none;border:0;text-decoration:none;height:32px;vertical-align:middle;width:32px" width="32"/><span class="tt-wordmark" style="color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:32px;padding-left:10px;vertical-align:middle">TimeTrack</span></a></td><td align="right" class="tt-muted" style="color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:32px;vertical-align:middle">Dataeksport</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class="tt-card" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DFE2DE;border-radius:10px;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;padding:32px 28px"><h1 style="color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:30px;margin:0 0 16px 0">Organisationens dataeksport er klar</h1><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Hej Test,</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Eksporten af organisationens data er færdig. Den er én ZIP-fil med alle data som JSON, en CSV-fil pr. tabel, de vedhæftede filer og en README, der forklarer indholdet.</p><table role="presentation" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px 0 16px"><tbody><tr class="tt-kv-row"><td class="tt-kv-label" style="border-bottom:1px solid #DFE2DE;color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;padding:9px 0;width:40%">Format</td><td class="tt-kv-value" style="border-bottom:1px solid #DFE2DE;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:500;padding:9px 0;text-align:right">ZIP</td></tr><tr class="tt-kv-row"><td class="tt-kv-label" style="border-bottom:1px solid #DFE2DE;color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;padding:9px 0;width:40%">Linket udløber</td><td class="tt-kv-value" style="border-bottom:1px solid #DFE2DE;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:700;padding:9px 0;text-align:right">1. december 2026 kl. 11.00</td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px"><tbody><tr><td class="tt-btn-td" bgcolor="#1E5B47" style="background-color:#1E5B47;border-radius:8px"><a href="https://example.com/x" class="tt-btn" style="background-color:#1E5B47;border:1px solid #1E5B47;border-radius:8px;color:#FFFFFF;display:inline-block;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;padding:13px 22px;text-decoration:none">Hent eksporten</a></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:16px 0 0 0;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">Du skal være logget ind som ejer eller administrator for at hente filen. Filen indeholder personoplysninger om medarbejdere og kunder, så gem den et sikkert sted. Når linket udløber, slettes filen fra TimeTrack.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="tt-footer" style="padding:16px 4px 0"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 4px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">Du modtager denne mail, fordi du bestilte en eksport af organisationens data i TimeTrack.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 4px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0"><a href="http://localhost:3000" style="color:#5F6663;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">TimeTrack</a> <!-- -->er lavet af Mahoje v/ Mads Holst Jensen, CVR 39413892.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
`;

