ding:32px 28px"><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Hej Test,</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Din prøveperiode på TimeTrack slutter om 3 dage. Vælger du ikke et abonnement, fortsætter din konto på Gratis, og alt, du har oprettet, er stadig gemt.</p><table role="presentation" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%" style="margin:16px 0"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor="#F2F3F0" style="background-color:#F2F3F0;border-radius:8px;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;padding:14px 18px"><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 4px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">Gratis har plads til 3 aktive kunder og 3 brugere.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">Fakturering og klippekort er med på Gratis. Opgraderer du, får du plads til flere aktive kunder og brugere.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px"><tbody><tr><td class="tt-btn-td" bgcolor="#1E5B47" style="background-color:#1E5B47;border-radius:8px"><a href="https://timetrack.dk/dashboard/settings/subscription" class="tt-btn" style="background-color:#1E5B47;border:1px solid #1E5B47;border-radius:8px;color:#FFFFFF;display:inline-block;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;padding:13px 22px;text-decoration:none">Se abonnementer</a></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Har du spørgsmål om planerne eller priserne, så svar på mailen. Jeg hjælper gerne.</p><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#DFE2DE;margin:24px 0 16px"/><table role="presentation" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="padding-right:14px;vertical-align:middle"><img alt="Mads Holst Jensen" height="56" src="https://timetrack.dk/brand/mads-128.jpg" style="display:block;outline:none;border:0;text-decoration:none;border-radius:50%;height:56px;width:56px" width="56"/></td><td style="vertical-align:middle"><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1A1D1C;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 2px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">Mads Holst Jensen</p><p class="tt-muted" style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">Bygger og driver TimeTrack</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td class="tt-footer" style="padding:16px 4px 0"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 4px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">Du modtager denne mail, fordi du har oprettet en konto på TimeTrack.<!-- --> <a href="http://localhost:3000/dashboard/settings/notifications" style="color:#5F6663;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Mailindstillinger</a>.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 4px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0"><a href="http://localhost:3000" style="color:#5F6663;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">TimeTrack</a> <!-- -->er lavet af Mahoje v/ Mads Holst Jensen, CVR 39413892.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
`;

exports[`mails til en TimeTrack-konto er uændrede > DripWelcomeEmail 1`] = `
"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html dir="ltr" lang="da"><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"/><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no, date=no, address=no, email=no"/><style>:root { color-scheme: light dark; supported-color-schemes: light dark; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
