er:2px solid #1E5B47;border-radius:50%;font-size:1px;height:14px;line-height:1px;width:14px"> </td><td class="tt-hul tt-hul-brugt" bgcolor="#1E5B47" width="14" height="14" style="background-color:#1E5B47;border:2px solid #1E5B47;border-radius:50%;font-size:1px;height:14px;line-height:1px;width:14px"> </td><td class="tt-hul tt-hul-tom" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="14" height="14" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:2px solid #1E5B47;border-radius:50%;font-size:1px;height:14px;line-height:1px;width:14px"> </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%" style="margin:16px 0"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor="#FFF7E6" style="background-color:#FFF7E6;border-left:3px solid #B45309;border-radius:6px;color:#7A3E06;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;padding:12px 16px">Overvej at kontakte kunden om en fornyelse nu, så arbejdet ikke går i stå, når kortet er tomt.</td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px"><tbody><tr><td class="tt-btn-td" bgcolor="#1E5B47" style="background-color:#1E5B47;border-radius:8px"><a href="https://timetrack.dk/dashboard/klippekort" class="tt-btn" style="background-color:#1E5B47;border:1px solid #1E5B47;border-radius:8px;color:#FFFFFF;display:inline-block;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;padding:13px 22px;text-decoration:none">Se klippekortet</a></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:16px 0 0 0;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">Du kan slå denne advarsel fra eller ændre grænsen under indstillinger.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="tt-footer" style="padding:16px 4px 0"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5F6663;font-family:&quot